[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 26958.388, "timestamp": "07:29:18", "text": "[音樂]，我真搞"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26961.27, "timestamp": "07:29:21", "text": "不懂。但我當時想，我還是等等吧，冷靜一下，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26974.07, "timestamp": "07:29:34", "text": "希望他們"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26975.75, "timestamp": "07:29:35", "text": "以後能回來，我會張開雙臂歡迎他們，告訴他們，沒關係，這很正常。現在很多人都會經歷這個階段。是啊，是啊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26980.23, "timestamp": "07:29:40", "text": "。所以，我完全能理解那種感覺。我覺得我也曾經有過那種感覺。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 26981.82, "timestamp": "07:29:41", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "joq"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26982.07, "timestamp": "07:29:42", "text": "當你的同儕和朋友都發展得很好，而你卻一無所獲的時候，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 26989.149, "timestamp": "07:29:49", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "joqqqqqqyyyyyy 😢"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 26992.007, "timestamp": "07:29:52", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i am sed"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26998.708, "timestamp": "07:29:58", "text": "你會想，為什麼"}]